Bio:
I've been bulding my career in the Technology Information area since 1990, through all levels of positions (Trainee, Operator, Programmer, Systems Analyst, Coordinator, Project Manager, IT Manager, IT Superintendent and now as a CIO).

Due to my experience with the Education and Automotive Business segments I've developed my knowledge in the Insurance Business in which I have over 18 years of experience.

Since 1999 I've been responsible for team and people management, having acted as a coordinator and as a general and outsourcing  project manager, later on I've acted as an account manager representing an IT Consulting Company before its clients, directing development projects, resources hiring and allocation. Following this period I grew inside Allianz Seguros from coordinator to director.

With great experience in forming and managing high performance teams, system architecture, governance, budget (managing, development and control), implementing better market practices/methodologies, inovation, internal and external auditing assistance, external (outsourcing, software factories and projects), system deployment, data migration and general system development.

It's worth mentioning the participation/leadership in great IT Projects:

- Extra management of the Allianz Seguros Architecture area for a year and a half, along with the leading of the Development Team, specially in the implementation of the Software Development Methodology based on 'Agile' for over 120 developers (8 technical managements);

- Complete EAI (Enterprise Application Integration) solution implementation between the all the systems used by the insurance company (136 systems);

- Participated in the Allianz Seguros Inovation Committee;

- Main responsible for the IT in a project of systemic platform exchange - from 30 to 4 systems in two years - over 350 thousand hours of systems development.

I have a degree in Economics and I’m Master in Business Administration and own a Specialization in Finance by Alliance Business School / University of Manchester UK.

I have over 17 years of experience in the Insurance industry, with experience in policy management and negotiation, customer service, cost management, team leadership, contract analysis, target control, development of sales strategies, among other activities pertinent.

Results orientation, problem solving and multitasking are some of my key skills.

⭐ Highlights achieved as Underwriting Manager at Chubb since 2020:

• 35% growth in new businesses compared to the previous year;
• Delivery of the result with current combined of 92%;
• Responsible for the team renewal rate of 88% YTD 2020;
• Responsible for a portfolio of approximately R$140MM year premium;
• Most relevant increase was for the Inland/Ocean segment in the state of SP, going from BRL 6m of premium issued in 2019 to BRL 10.8m in 2020.

A principal missão da BRM UCHÔA é desenvolver um trabalho que tem por objetivo:
- identificar as necessidades de cada cliente na contratação de apólices de seguro;
- oferecer produtos com condições técnicas diferenciadas e condições comerciais extremamente competitivas;
- reduzir os custos na contratação de diversos ramos de seguro, com destaque para Transportes (Nacional e Internacional - Importação e Exportação), Saúde Empresarial, Vida em Grupo, Empresarial e Obras de Arte;
- prestar aos nossos segurados a assistência necessária quando da ocorrência de sinistros;

Atuação na área Comercial, com experiência em vendas, prospecção e fidelização de clientes;
Habilidade no atendimento presencial, telefônico e e-comerce; esclarecimento de dúvidas sobre produtos; 
Experiência na análise das necessidades do cliente, elaboração de ações fora da empresa; estudo de produtos concorrentes e análise de preço dos concorrentes;
Vivência na divulgação de ações promocionais e realização de atividades de campo;  
Elaboração de relatórios e planilhas  auxiliando na definição e alcance de metas.
